Cross-check on the runners' shape, measured this round: tests/run-all.sh's
`tests=()` array holds 61 entries and this epic's 13 suites occupy positions
49..61 — the tail of the list. tests/run-all.ps1 holds 44 entries.

NEITHER RUNNER WAS EDITED BY T-013. `git diff --name-only 71e0f0f2 HEAD` does not
list tests/run-all.sh or tests/run-all.ps1 at all. So "all 25 already registered"
is not a claim about work T-013 did; it is a finding about T-001..T-012, and the
absence of a runner edit is the proof that no backfill was needed.

